@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AAEB7
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #7B919E
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M05 — Manual preparation and separate progress change
actor Applicant as U
participant "Application record" as A
participant "Tailored resume" as R
participant "Editable cover letter" as C
U -> A : Supply company / opportunity preparation
A -> A : Check current authority and valid context
alt Denied or invalid preparation
 A --> U : Denied / validation result
else Permitted preparation
 U -> A : Associate intended resume; save authored letter
 A -> R : Check permitted resume association
 R --> A : Authorized context or denial
 alt Intended resume association permitted
  A -> C : Retain permitted authored text
  C --> A : Actual save result
  A --> U : Actual complete / incomplete / failed preparation
 else Resume association denied
  A --> U : Denied; do not create the prohibited association
 end
 opt Separate explicit progress change
  U -> A : Request permitted transition or correction
  A -> A : Evaluate transition / attribution / time policy
  A --> U : Actual progress result
 end
end
note over A,C
No AI drafting, automatic portal submission or employer receipt.
A saved preparation is not actual submitted-material capture.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
